  "description": "The proposed works are to the business address of Avolites, a company manufacturing lighting and video control software+hardware.  They wish to upgrade the appearance of their existing building and make it a better environment for staff and visitors.  This will be done in phased works. This first phase proposes the creation of a new entrance to the building in a more prominent position on the East facing facade.  The current entrance is not clearly visible and does not have any presence at street level. The proposed location for the new entrance is through an old loading bay (which has since been bricked up) and has an adjoining interior space which will serve as the new Reception area (currently used as a meeting room).  The works will involve opening up part of the wall and removing the windows within the old loading bay, and introducing a new glazed facade, with a rendered surround.  For security, a new roller shutter door will be required to close down the entrance outside office hours. Signage locations would also be updated, as per the drawings",
